message: "If you use NovaShield in your research, please cite this software."
type: software

title: "NovaShield: Explainable AI Cybersecurity Research Prototype"

authors:
  - family-names: "Batool"
    given-names: "Maria"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-1971-3508"

abstract: >-
  NovaShield is a cybersecurity research prototype exploring explainable
  machine learning for network intrusion detection, network-flow feature
  engineering, SHAP-based model interpretation, and human-centred security
  operations. Its initial research release includes controlled numerical
  feature validation, offline machine-learning experiments, bounded network
  observation, and an experimental Security Operations Console.

